== Effects ==
* Picking up a {{e|Red Heart}} has a 50% chance to consume the heart and spawn [[Blue Spider]]s, causing a fart that deals no damage.
** Isaac can pick up hearts even while at full health. In this case, the chance goes to 100%.
* Has no effect on {{e|Rotten Heart}}s, {{E|Blended Heart}}s, or any other type of heart.

== Notes ==
* The number of spiders spawned depends on the type of heart that was picked up:
** {{e|Half Red Heart}}s will spawn 1-3 spiders.
** Full {{e|Red Heart}}s will spawn 3-5 spiders.
** {{e|Double Heart}}s will spawn 6-8 spiders.
* The trinket allows characters that cannot use red hearts to gain value from red hearts.
* Items that directly heal Isaac, such as {{i|Yum Heart}}, cannot produce any spiders. The hearts must be picked up off the ground.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: All types of hearts can be converted to spiders.
* {{i|Hypercoagulation}} / {{p|Soul of Magdalene}} / {{c|Tainted Magdalene}}: Temporary hearts can be turned into blue spiders.
* {{i|Options?}}: Converting hearts dropped by Options? will not cause the other consumable to disappear.

== Interactions ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket}} / {{i|Mom's Box}}: No effect.
* {{i|Candy Heart}}: Does not increase stats if the heart is converted to spiders.
* {{i|The Jar}}: Has a 50% chance to turn a heart into a blue spider or put it in The Jar.

