== Trivia ==
* Apple of Sodom was a cut trinket from Antibirth. It was most likely going to be an unlock for the unused character [[anti:Edith|Edith]].
* [[wikipedia:Calotropis procera|Calotropis procera]], known under the name of apple of Sodom, is a plant that produces a hollow fruit with fibers inside of it. It is named so because it supposedly grew on the land of [[wikipedia:Sodom and Gomorrah|Sodom]]. In the Hebrew Bible, the apple of Sodom is referenced metaphorically to represent something that appears good but is actually poisonous.

